  "Question": "The purchase price is 20 yuan. When the selling price is $x$ yuan, daily sales are $100-2x$ units. Find the maximum daily profit. (Unit: yuan.)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "450",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The daily profit is $y=(x-20)(100-2x)=-2x^2+140x-2000=-2(x-35)^2+450$. When $x=35$, the maximum profit is 450 yuan.",
